@startuml EAMD-5LayerArchitecture
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title EAMD.ucp 5-Layer Architecture Reference\nOriginal EAM layers + UpDown P7 extension

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' LAYER 5: UX & Views
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

package "Layer 5 — UX & Views" as L5 #FCE4EC {
  note as N5
    **Purpose:** User-facing components
    **EAMD original:** Card, Form, FileSystem, UserPanel,
      Workflow, css/, html/ — Web Components, visual elements
    **UpDown:** ONCECLI, Web4TSComponentCLI, Lit Views
      (OnceServerStatusView, OncePeerItemView, etc.)
    **Rule:** Presentation only, delegates to L2/L4
  end note
}

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' LAYER 4: Async Orchestration (ADDED BY UPDOWN)
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

package "Layer 4 — Async Orchestration" as L4 #FFF3E0 {
  note as N4
    **Purpose:** Asynchronous coordination
    **EAMD original:** DID NOT EXIST (no L4 in EAMD.ucp)
    **UpDown added:** IOR (Internet Object Reference),
      FileLoader, HTTPSLoader, WebSocketLoader,
      CertificateOrchestrator, TSCompletion,
      ProxyRoute, ReverseProxyRoute
    **P7 Rule:** ONLY layer where async/await is allowed
      L1-L3 must be synchronous
    **Key insight:** This split enables testability —
      sync logic (L1-L3) is easy to test,
      async orchestration (L4) handles I/O
  end note
}

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' LAYER 3: Interfaces & Runtime Types
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

package "Layer 3 — Interfaces & Runtime Types" as L3 #F5F5F5 {
  note as N3
    **Purpose:** Contracts + domain services
    **EAMD original:** DomainEntity, Filter, Governance,
      Service, connectors, accounting, inventory —
      EAM DOMAIN BUSINESS LOGIC (not just interfaces!)
    **UpDown:** *.interface.ts files + RUNTIME CLASSES:
      JsInterface (P35: runtime interface base),
      UcpModel (ISR proxy — hundreds of lines of logic),
      TypeDescriptor, PersistenceManager, Storage
    **Key insight:** L3 is NOT "just interfaces" — it contains
      runtime classes that NEED to exist at runtime
      for RelatedObjects, type checking, and ISR
    **Rule:** Synchronous (P7)
  end note
}

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' LAYER 2: Implementation
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

package "Layer 2 — Implementation (Default* classes)" as L2 #E8F5E9 {
  note as N2
    **Purpose:** Concrete implementations
    **EAMD original:** DefaultFile, DefaultFolder,
      User, Session, RESTClient, Web4Proxy, TestRunner —
      the Default* classes that implement L3 interfaces
    **UpDown:** UcpComponent, UcpController, TypeRegistry,
      DefaultUnit, UcpStorage, HTTPServer, HTTPRouter,
      DefaultWeb4TSComponent, DefaultCLI, SemanticVersion
    **P6 Rule:** Empty constructor + init(scenario)
    **P16 Rule:** Object.verb naming (linksGet, scenarioSave)
    **Rule:** Synchronous (P7)
  end note
}

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' LAYER 1: Kernel & OS Infrastructure
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

package "Layer 1 — Kernel & OS Infrastructure" as L1 #E3F2FD {
  note as N1
    **Purpose:** Runtime kernel and OS primitives
    **EAMD original:** Thinglish/Once kernel (the ONCE runtime),
      OnceServices (EventService) — the foundation
      that everything else runs on
    **UpDown:** ONCE.ts (kernel singleton),
      NodeOSInfrastructure (wraps os module),
      LoggingUtils, HostnameParser,
      PlatformDetection (isNode check),
      DefaultEnvironmentModel
    **Key insight:** L1 is specifically the KERNEL —
      not generic infrastructure. Only code that
      MUST run before anything else belongs here.
    **Rule:** Synchronous (P7)
  end note
}

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' Dependency Direction
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

L5 -[hidden]-> L4
L4 -[hidden]-> L3
L3 -[hidden]-> L2
L2 -[hidden]-> L1

note right of L5
  **Dependency Rule**
  Higher layers depend on lower layers.
  Never upward: L1 never imports from L2.

  **P7 Async Boundary**
  L1, L2, L3 = synchronous
  L4 = async (await allowed)
  L5 = async (UI events)

  **EAMD vs UpDown**
  EAMD had 4 layers (1,2,3,5)
  UpDown added L4 for P7 async separation
end note

@enduml
